From 105c6af9b8eb7b49117689c792743aeaddd8f2e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: myamusashi <myamusashi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:06:23 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sine): support configuration-shipped local mods

Add profiles.<name>.sine.localMods: mods whose files ship with the
configuration instead of coming from the Sine/Zen stores.

- updater merge-copies each mod's source into the profile (rendered
  outputs like vastctl-generated css survive switches), writes a
  store-origin mods.json entry (scripts need origin "store" and an
  object-shaped scripts map for getScripts), keeps local ids out of
  the purge, and tracks them in the managed state
- sources are interpolated as derivation inputs, so the store paths
  the script references are protected from GC
- regression test: sine-local-mods
---
